# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# Supplier files we may not redistribute. Only their row in vendor-index.csv is
# committed; the file itself is fetched from the brand under the brand's terms.
# Validation warns rather than fails when one is absent, so CI stays green on a
# fresh clone.
#
# List the exact paths your fetch-only rows name, for example:
#
# modules/thk/modules/shs-rail/cad/parts/SHS20R300.FCStd
# modules/thk/modules/shs-rail/cad/original/SHS20R300.step

# FreeCAD rotates a backup beside every document it saves. It is a copy of the
# file next to it, so it never belongs in the history.
*.FCBak
*.FCStd1
